# Canonical origin of the deployed site, with no trailing slash.
#
# Optional, but recommended for production. When set, the build emits absolute
# canonical / hreflang / Open Graph URLs, a sitemap at /sitemap.xml, and a
# Sitemap directive in robots.txt. When unset the site still builds and works —
# canonical and hreflang stay root-relative and the sitemap is skipped.
VITE_SITE_URL=https://neurocare.example
